### 1. Get operations (expect 200, paged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations?page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get operations filtered by date (expect 200, only September)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Create an operation (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "categoryId": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "type": "Expense",
  "amount": 1250.00,
  "date": "2026-10-05",
  "comment": "Groceries"
}

